⚡ AURA BATTLE
Game Design & Technical Specification
Version 0.1 — Master Design Document

Genre: Real-time PvP / PvE / Progression / Social
Platform: Roblox
Core fantasy: Become the strongest player in the server, but the stronger you become, the more attention you attract.
Core resource: Aura
Combat: Real-time
Primary progression: Aura → HP / Damage / Skills
Social mechanic: Weak players can cooperate to defeat stronger players.
Monetization: Robux purchases, boosts, consumables, premium convenience.
Target MVP development: ~7 days with AI-assisted development, assuming scope discipline.

1. TẦM NHÌN
1.1. Một câu mô tả

Farm Aura → become stronger → enter dangerous PvP zones → defeat players → steal part of their Aura → become a server threat → attract increasingly larger groups of players.

Game phải tạo cảm giác:

“Tao càng mạnh, càng nhiều người muốn giết tao.”

Đây là mechanic trung tâm.

